'''Skye''' is a female [[Pixie]] [[NPC]] [[Merchant]] that can be found in near the  [[Snowhill]] [[Cooking Table]]. 

Skye sells [[Chef]] [[Job]] related [[items]], and was introduced in game on the update of October 1, 2013.
==Sells==
*[[Broiled Chef Pants]]
*[[Broiled Chef Hat]]
*[[Broiled Chef Shoes]]
*[[Broiled Chef Shirt]]
*[[Chef's Charbroiled Flair Shard]]
*[[Chef's Power Shard of Talent III]]
*[[Chef's Ring of Talent III]]
*[[Chef's Skillet of Timing III]]
